<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no">
<title>卤炸帮 · 猪货系列 · 咔库秘制</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:#1a1410;color:#e8ddd0;padding:24px 16px;line-height:1.7}
.card{max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;background:#231e18;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
.meta{padding:20px 22px 14px;background:#2a221b;border-bottom:1px solid #3a3026}
.meta .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#f5a623;background:#3a2e1c;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:6px}
.meta h1{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#f0d6b0;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:2px}
.meta .sub{font-size:12px;color:#8a7a6a;margin-bottom:10px}
.meta .tags{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.meta .tags span{font-size:10px;padding:2px 10px;background:#3a3026;border-radius:12px;color:#c0a892}
.level-banner{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:10px 22px;background:#2a221b;border-bottom:1px solid #3a3026;flex-wrap:wrap}
.level-item{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#3a3026;color:#c0a892}
.level-item.high{background:#f5a623;color:#1a1410}
.section{padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #3a3026}
.s-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#f0d6b0;margin-bottom:10px;padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:2px solid #3a3026}
.story{font-size:13px;line-height:2;color:#c0a892}
.story em{color:#f5a623;font-style:normal;font-weight:600}
.cost-box{padding:12px 14px;background:#2a221b;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;padding:4px 0;color:#c0a892}
.row .v{font-weight:600;color:#f0d6b0}
.row.tot{border-top:1px solid #3a3026;margin-top:4px;padding-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:#f5a623}
.roi{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}
.roi-b{flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:#c0a892}
.roi-b .d{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:2px 0}
.roi-b.c{background:#3a2e1c;color:#f5a623}
.roi-b.n{background:#2a3026;color:#8ab87a}
.roi-b.i{background:#1e2a2a;color:#5ab8b8}
.timing-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
.timing-row{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:6px 10px;background:#2a221b;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#c0a892}
.timing-row .name{width:48px;font-weight:700;color:#f0d6b0;flex-shrink:0}
.timing-row .steps{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-left:8px}
.timing-row .steps span{padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}
.timing-row .steps .lu{background:#4a2a1a;color:#f5a623}
.timing-row .steps .men{background:#2a3a2a;color:#8ab87a}
.timing-row .steps .zha{background:#3a1a1a;color:#f07850}
.process-list{padding:0}
.process-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:6px 0;font-size:12px;color:#c0a892;border-bottom:1px solid #2a221b}
.process-item:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.process-item .step-num{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#4a3a2a;color:#f5a623;text-align:center;line-height:20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px}
.process-item .step-text{flex:1}
.talk{background:#2a221b;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;color:#c0a892;line-height:1.8}
.alert{background:#3a2e1c;border-left:3px solid #f5a623;padding:8px 12px;font-size:10px;color:#f5a623;margin-top:6px;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0}
.paywall{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2a221b,#1e1a14);border:1.5px dashed #4a3a2a;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;margin:14px 22px;text-align:center}
.paywall .price{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#f5a623}
.paywall .desc{font-size:11px;color:#8a7a6a;margin:4px 0 12px}
.paywall .btn{display:inline-block;background:#f5a623;color:#1a1410;padding:8px 28px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:.2s}
.footer{text-align:center;padding:16px 22px;font-size:10px;color:#6a5a4a}
.footer .brand{font-size:11px;color:#8a7a6a;font-weight:600}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">LZ_003 · 咔库秘制</div>
  <h1>卤炸帮 · 猪货系列</h1>
  <div class="sub">卤后炸至酥脆 · 撒上秘制干料 · 猪全身都是宝</div>
  <div class="tags"><span>#卤炸帮</span><span>#猪系列</span><span>#猪蹄</span><span>#猪耳</span><span>#卤炸</span></div>
</div>
<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">🔥 猪蹄是王牌</span>
  <span class="level-item">毛利率 50%+</span>
  <span class="level-item">6种猪货出品</span>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">📖 产品说</div>
  <div class="story">
    猪货卤炸是卤炸帮的硬核系列。猪蹄软糯弹牙、猪耳朵脆爽有嚼劲、猪头肉肥而不腻——每一味都先以川香辣卤水小火卤透焖入味，再下油锅炸至表皮酥脆，撒上秘制干料。外酥里嫩，满口脂香，宵夜王者。<br><br>
    三大核心：<em>卤水要「老」</em>——猪货胶质重，卤水越养越香；<em>时间分区是关键</em>——猪蹄猪头肉必须卤够时间，否则咬不动；<em>炸制分寸</em>——猪蹄炸2分钟出虎皮纹，猪耳炸1.5分钟保持脆感就够。<br><br>
    按猪蹄计，单个成本约¥10，售价¥20-25，毛利率50%以上。夜市宵夜档一晚走30-50个猪蹄是常态，配其他猪货品类一起走，客单价轻松拉高。
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">⏱ 各食材卤制/炸制时间表</div>
  <div class="timing-grid">
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">猪耳朵</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤30min</span><span class="men">焖40min</span><span class="zha">炸1.5min</span></div></div>
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">猪蹄</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤50min</span><span class="men">焖60min</span><span class="zha">炸2min</span></div></div>
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">猪舌</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤30min</span><span class="men">焖30min</span><span class="zha">炸1.5min</span></div></div>
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">猪尾巴</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤40min</span><span class="men">焖40min</span><span class="zha">炸1.5min</span></div></div>
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">猪头肉</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤70min</span><span class="men">焖60min</span><span class="zha">炸2min</span></div></div>
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">猪大肠</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤70min</span><span class="men">焖30min</span><span class="zha">炸2min</span></div></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">📋 工艺</div>
  <div class="process-list">
    <div class="process-item"><span class="step-num">1</span><span class="step-text"><strong style="color:#f0d6b0">出水：</strong>冷水下锅+葱姜料酒，猪蹄猪头肉需多煮5分钟去腥</span></div>
    <div class="process-item"><span class="step-num">2</span><span class="step-text"><strong style="color:#f0d6b0">卤制：</strong>共用川香辣卤水，按时间表小火卤</span></div>
    <div class="process-item"><span class="step-num">3</span><span class="step-text"><strong style="color:#f0d6b0">焖制：</strong>关火后按时间表焖，猪蹄至少焖60min出胶质</span></div>
    <div class="process-item"><span class="step-num">4</span><span class="step-text"><strong style="color:#f0d6b0">炸制（可选）：</strong>油温170-180℃，炸至表皮微焦</span></div>
    <div class="process-item"><span class="step-num">5</span><span class="step-text"><strong style="color:#f0d6b0">撒料：</strong>共用卤炸干料，撒匀趁热出餐</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">💰 成本利润（按猪蹄计）</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>单个成本</span><span class="v">¥10</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>售价区间</span><span class="v">¥20-25/个</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>毛利率</span><span class="v">50-55%</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>夜市日销</span><span class="v">30-50个</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日营收</span><span class="v">≈¥600-1,250</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>原料成本</span><span class="v">≈¥300-500</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>摊位+杂费</span><span class="v">~¥80-150</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>日净赚</span><span class="v">≈¥220-600</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div class="d">3-5天</div>保守</div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div class="d">2-3天</div>正常</div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div class="d">1-2天</div>理想</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">💬 话术</div>
  <div class="talk">「卤炸猪蹄——先卤后炸，虎皮纹满满，咬一口软糯黏嘴！」<br>「猪耳朵脆嘣嘣的，下酒菜首选，走一份试试？」</div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">📋 工艺流程（详细版）</div>
  <div class="story">• 猪货解冻清洗，猪蹄猪头肉冷水浸泡40分钟去血水<br>• 冷水下锅加葱姜料酒，煮至变色捞出冲凉（猪蹄多煮5分钟）<br>• 川香辣卤水烧开，下猪货按时间表小火卤<br>• 关火后按时间表焖（猪蹄60分钟焖出胶质，这是灵魂）<br>• 捞出晾至表面微干（不晾干炸不酥）<br>• 油温170-180℃，下锅按时间表炸至表皮微焦<br>• 捞出沥油，趁热撒上秘制卤炸干料<br>• 按个/份装袋出餐</div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">🚫 避坑</div>
  <div class="story">• <em>猪蹄焯水不够</em>——猪蹄腥味重，冷水下锅煮开后多煮5分钟，否则卤出来有腥膻味。<br>• <em>卤不够时间</em>——猪蹄至少卤50+焖60，不到时间胶原蛋白没转化，咬不动别找原因。<br>• <em>炸太久</em>——猪蹄2分钟出虎皮纹就够了，炸过头皮硬不软糯。<br>• <em>不晾干就炸</em>——卤完捞出表面带水分，直接下锅会溅油且不酥，晾干是关键一步。<br>• <em>猪大肠处理不到位</em>——大肠去油要留薄薄一层油，去干净了没味，留太多腻。清洗用面粉+盐反复搓洗。</div>
</div>
